  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>We know that the period of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>cos&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"h